<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 3: </span><span id="Pt0.A1.T3.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Per-task evaluation results of <span id="Pt0.A1.T3.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">HyVLA-0</span>.<span id="Pt0.A1.T3.4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">5</span> on the RoboTwin 2.0 benchmark <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib33" title="" class="ltx_ref">27</a>]</cite>.</span></figcaption>
