<section id="Pt0.A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Supplementary Deployment</h2>

<section id="Pt0.A2.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.1 </span>UMI-to-Robot Deployment Derivation</h3>

<section id="Pt0.A2.SS1.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Humanoid-specific derivation.</h4>

<div id="Pt0.A2.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Pt0.A2.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">UMI demonstrations are recorded in its own world frame and lack a torso pose. As end effector poses on Astribot S1 are defined in its own chassis frame, as mentioned in Eq. (<a href="#S5.E11" title="In 5.1 Embodiment-Agnostic Platform Mapping ‣ 5 Deployment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a>), and a torso pose in the chassis frame is crucial for reasonable upper-body poses and efficient IK solving, we need to find a mapping from UMI world frame to S1 chassis frame and figure out a torso pose as well. Two methodologies have been proved feasible either by our experiments or by related works:</p>
<ol id="Pt0.A2.I1" class="ltx_enumerate" style="--ltx-enum-leftmargin:1.6em;">
<li id="Pt0.A2.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1.</span> 
<div id="Pt0.A2.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Pt0.A2.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Pt0.A2.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Heuristic torso/head pose inference (used in our experiments).</span> A lightweight rule-based estimator consumes bimanual gripper poses <math id="Pt0.A2.I1.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{{}^{W}T_{G^{\mathrm{L}}_{t}},{}^{W}T_{G^{\mathrm{R}}_{t}}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>T</mi><mprescripts></mprescripts><msubsup><mi>G</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>L</mi></msubsup><mrow></mrow><mrow></mrow><mi>W</mi></mmultiscripts><mo>,</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>T</mi><mprescripts></mprescripts><msubsup><mi>G</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>R</mi></msubsup><mrow></mrow><mrow></mrow><mi>W</mi></mmultiscripts><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{{}^{W}T_{G^{\mathrm{L}}_{t}},{}^{W}T_{G^{\mathrm{R}}_{t}}\}</annotation></semantics></math> and infers the world-to-chassis transform, the torso pose, and the head pose such that (i) the torso forward axis aligns with the centroid of the two gripper positions and (ii) the torso height places both grippers within an empirically established comfortable reach shell of the upper body; see Algorithm <a href="#algorithm1" title="In item 1 ‣ Humanoid-specific derivation. ‣ B.1 UMI-to-Robot Deployment Derivation ‣ Appendix B Supplementary Deployment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> for details. It assumes that the UMI world frame and the robot chassis frame are related by a pure translation (identical orientation), which holds on Astribot S1. For robot platforms whose chassis frame has a different orientation, an additional fixed rotation can be applied without further altering the algorithm.</p>
</div>
<figure id="algorithm1" class="ltx_float ltx_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="algorithm1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span>Heuristic Mapping from UMI Gripper Poses to Whole-Body Targets in the Chassis Frame</figcaption>
<div id="algorithm1.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_numbers_left ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="algorithm1.4.1" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Input :</span> <math id="algorithm1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T^{W}_{L},T^{W}_{R}\!\in\!SE(3)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>W</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>W</mi></msubsup><mo rspace="0.108em">∈</mo><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>E</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T^{W}_{L},T^{W}_{R}\!\in\!SE(3)</annotation></semantics></math>   <span id="algorithm1.4.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">/* </span><span id="algorithm1.4.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">UMI gripper poses in the world frame <math id="algorithm1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>W</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W</annotation></semantics></math> */</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.2" class="ltx_listingline">
                      <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">1</span></span>
                    <math id="algorithm1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>L</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L</annotation></semantics></math>   <span id="algorithm1.4.2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">/* </span><span id="algorithm1.4.2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">full nominal arm reach (meters) */</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.3" class="ltx_listingline">
                      <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">2</span></span>
                    <math id="algorithm1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h_{0}</annotation></semantics></math>   <span id="algorithm1.4.3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">/* </span><span id="algorithm1.4.3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">nominal standing height of chassis--shoulder line */</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.4" class="ltx_listingline">
                      <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">3</span></span>
                    <math id="algorithm1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha\!\in\![0,1]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0.108em" rspace="0.108em">∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha\!\in\![0,1]</annotation></semantics></math>   <span id="algorithm1.4.4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">/* </span><span id="algorithm1.4.4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">horizontal back-shift as a fraction of <math id="algorithm1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>L</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L</annotation></semantics></math> */</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.5" class="ltx_listingline">
                      <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">4</span></span>
                    <math id="algorithm1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta z_{C}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>C</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta z_{C}</annotation></semantics></math>   <span id="algorithm1.4.5.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">/* </span><span id="algorithm1.4.5.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">net vertical offset for chassis localization */</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.6" class="ltx_listingline">
                      <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">5</span></span>
                    <math id="algorithm1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>θ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta_{0}</annotation></semantics></math>   <span id="algorithm1.4.6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">/* </span><span id="algorithm1.4.6.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">constant forward torso pitch */</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.7" class="ltx_listingline">
                      <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">6</span></span>
                    <math id="algorithm1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta\!\in\![0,1]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo lspace="0.108em" rspace="0.108em">∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta\!\in\![0,1]</annotation></semantics></math>   <span id="algorithm1.4.7.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">/* </span><span id="algorithm1.4.7.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">blend factor between hand height and <math id="algorithm1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h_{0}</annotation></semantics></math> */</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.8" class="ltx_listingline">
                      <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">7</span></span>
                    <math id="algorithm1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R_{\mathrm{align}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>align</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_{\mathrm{align}}</annotation></semantics></math>   <span id="algorithm1.4.8.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">/* </span><span id="algorithm1.4.8.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">fixed UMI<math id="algorithm1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math>robot gripper-axis rotation */</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.9" class="ltx_listingline">
                      <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.9.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">8</span></span>
                    <math id="algorithm1.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T^{T}_{H}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>T</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T^{T}_{H}</annotation></semantics></math>   <span id="algorithm1.4.9.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">/* </span><span id="algorithm1.4.9.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">fixed torso-to-head calibration transform */</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.10" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.10.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Output :</span> Chassis-frame targets <math id="algorithm1.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T^{C}_{L},T^{C}_{R},T^{C}_{T},T^{C}_{H}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>C</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>C</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>C</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>C</mi></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T^{C}_{L},T^{C}_{R},T^{C}_{T},T^{C}_{H}</annotation></semantics></math>.
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.11" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.11.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">/* </span><span id="algorithm1.4.11.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Step 1: align UMI gripper axes to robot gripper axes  */</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.12" class="ltx_listingline">
                      <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.12.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">9</span></span>
                    <math id="algorithm1.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T^{W}_{L}\leftarrow T^{W}_{L}\,R_{\mathrm{align}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>W</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>W</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>align</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T^{W}_{L}\leftarrow T^{W}_{L}\,R_{\mathrm{align}}</annotation></semantics></math>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.13" class="ltx_listingline">
                      <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.13.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">10</span></span>
                    <math id="algorithm1.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T^{W}_{R}\leftarrow T^{W}_{R}\,R_{\mathrm{align}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>W</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>W</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>align</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T^{W}_{R}\leftarrow T^{W}_{R}\,R_{\mathrm{align}}</annotation></semantics></math>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.14" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.14.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">/* </span><span id="algorithm1.4.14.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Step 2: hand midpoint and horizontal facing direction  */</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.15" class="ltx_listingline">
                      <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.15.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">11</span></span>
                    <math id="algorithm1.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m^{W}\leftarrow\tfrac{1}{2}\bigl(t(T^{W}_{L})+t(T^{W}_{R})\bigr)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mi>W</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>W</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>W</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m^{W}\leftarrow\tfrac{1}{2}\bigl(t(T^{W}_{L})+t(T^{W}_{R})\bigr)</annotation></semantics></math>
  <span id="algorithm1.4.15.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">/* </span><span id="algorithm1.4.15.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">mean of hand translations */</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.16" class="ltx_listingline">
                      <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.16.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">12</span></span>
                    <math id="algorithm1.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f^{W}\leftarrow\Pi_{xy}(m^{W})\,/\,\lVert\Pi_{xy}(m^{W})\rVert" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mi>W</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Π</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mi>W</mi></msup><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.114em">/</mo><mrow><mo fence="true" rspace="0em">∥</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Π</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mi>W</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo fence="true" lspace="0em">∥</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f^{W}\leftarrow\Pi_{xy}(m^{W})\,/\,\lVert\Pi_{xy}(m^{W})\rVert</annotation></semantics></math>
  <span id="algorithm1.4.16.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">/* </span><span id="algorithm1.4.16.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">unit vector in world XY plane */</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.17" class="ltx_listingline">
                      <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.17.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">13</span></span>
                    <span id="algorithm1.4.17.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <em id="algorithm1.4.17.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><math id="algorithm1.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lVert\Pi_{xy}(m^{W})\rVert&lt;\varepsilon" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo fence="true" rspace="0em">∥</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Π</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mi>W</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0.1389em">∥</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.1389em">&lt;</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lVert\Pi_{xy}(m^{W})\rVert&lt;\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></em> <span id="algorithm1.4.17.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.18" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
                      <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.18.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">14</span></span>
                    <math id="algorithm1.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f^{W}\leftarrow\mathbf{e}_{x}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mi>W</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><msub><mi>𝐞</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f^{W}\leftarrow\mathbf{e}_{x}</annotation></semantics></math>
  <span id="algorithm1.4.18.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">/* </span><span id="algorithm1.4.18.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">degenerate fallback */</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.19" class="ltx_listingline">
                      <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.19.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">15</span></span>
                    end if
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.20" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.20.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">/* </span><span id="algorithm1.4.20.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Step 3: one-shot chassis localization (cached per episode)  */</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.21" class="ltx_listingline">
                      <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.21.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">16</span></span>
                    <span id="algorithm1.4.21.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <em id="algorithm1.4.21.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><math id="algorithm1.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T^{W}_{C}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>W</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T^{W}_{C}</annotation></semantics></math> is not cached</em> <span id="algorithm1.4.21.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.22" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
                      <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.22.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">17</span></span>
                    <math id="algorithm1.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p^{W}_{C}\leftarrow m^{W}-\alpha L\,f^{W}+\Delta z_{C}\,\mathbf{e}_{z}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>W</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mi>W</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>L</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mi>W</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐞</mi><mi>z</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p^{W}_{C}\leftarrow m^{W}-\alpha L\,f^{W}+\Delta z_{C}\,\mathbf{e}_{z}</annotation></semantics></math>
  <span id="algorithm1.4.22.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">/* </span><span id="algorithm1.4.22.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">back-shift + vertical drop */</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.23" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
                      <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.23.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">18</span></span>
                    <math id="algorithm1.m23" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T^{W}_{C}\leftarrow(\,\mathbf{I},\,p^{W}_{C}\,)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>W</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐈</mi><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>W</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T^{W}_{C}\leftarrow(\,\mathbf{I},\,p^{W}_{C}\,)</annotation></semantics></math>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.24" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
                      <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.24.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">19</span></span>
                    cache <math id="algorithm1.m24" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T^{W}_{C}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>W</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T^{W}_{C}</annotation></semantics></math>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.25" class="ltx_listingline">
                      <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.25.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">20</span></span>
                    end if
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.26" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.26.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">/* </span><span id="algorithm1.4.26.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Step 4: re-express grippers and helpers in the chassis frame  */</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.27" class="ltx_listingline">
                      <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.27.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">21</span></span>
                    <math id="algorithm1.m25" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T^{C}_{L}\leftarrow(T^{W}_{C})^{-1}\,T^{W}_{L}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>C</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>W</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>W</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T^{C}_{L}\leftarrow(T^{W}_{C})^{-1}\,T^{W}_{L}</annotation></semantics></math>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.28" class="ltx_listingline">
                      <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.28.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">22</span></span>
                    <math id="algorithm1.m26" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T^{C}_{R}\leftarrow(T^{W}_{C})^{-1}\,T^{W}_{R}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>C</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>W</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>W</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T^{C}_{R}\leftarrow(T^{W}_{C})^{-1}\,T^{W}_{R}</annotation></semantics></math>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.29" class="ltx_listingline">
                      <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.29.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">23</span></span>
                    <math id="algorithm1.m27" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m^{C}\leftarrow(T^{W}_{C})^{-1}\,m^{W}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mi>C</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>W</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mi>W</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m^{C}\leftarrow(T^{W}_{C})^{-1}\,m^{W}</annotation></semantics></math>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.30" class="ltx_listingline">
                      <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.30.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">24</span></span>
                    <math id="algorithm1.m28" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f^{C}\leftarrow R(T^{W}_{C})^{\top}\,f^{W}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mi>C</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>W</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mi>W</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f^{C}\leftarrow R(T^{W}_{C})^{\top}\,f^{W}</annotation></semantics></math>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.31" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.31.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">/* </span><span id="algorithm1.4.31.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Step 5: heuristic torso pose  */</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.32" class="ltx_listingline">
                      <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.32.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">25</span></span>
                    <math id="algorithm1.m29" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\psi\leftarrow\mathrm{atan2}(f^{C}_{y},\,f^{C}_{x})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ψ</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>atan2</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>f</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>C</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>f</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>C</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\psi\leftarrow\mathrm{atan2}(f^{C}_{y},\,f^{C}_{x})</annotation></semantics></math>
  <span id="algorithm1.4.32.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">/* </span><span id="algorithm1.4.32.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">yaw aligned with the hands */</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.33" class="ltx_listingline">
                      <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.33.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">26</span></span>
                    <math id="algorithm1.m30" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R^{C}_{T}\leftarrow R_{z}(\psi)\,R_{y}(\theta_{0})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>C</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ψ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R^{C}_{T}\leftarrow R_{z}(\psi)\,R_{y}(\theta_{0})</annotation></semantics></math>
  <span id="algorithm1.4.33.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">/* </span><span id="algorithm1.4.33.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">yaw, then constant forward pitch */</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.34" class="ltx_listingline">
                      <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.34.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">27</span></span>
                    <math id="algorithm1.m31" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p^{C}_{T}\leftarrow\bigl(0,\,0,\,(1-\delta)\,m^{C}_{z}+\delta\,h_{0}\bigr)^{\top}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>C</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><msup><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn> 0</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>m</mi><mi>z</mi><mi>C</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p^{C}_{T}\leftarrow\bigl(0,\,0,\,(1-\delta)\,m^{C}_{z}+\delta\,h_{0}\bigr)^{\top}</annotation></semantics></math>
  <span id="algorithm1.4.34.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">/* </span><span id="algorithm1.4.34.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">height = convex blend of hand and standing */</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.35" class="ltx_listingline">
                      <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.35.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">28</span></span>
                    <math id="algorithm1.m32" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T^{C}_{T}\leftarrow(\,R^{C}_{T},\,p^{C}_{T}\,)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>C</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>C</mi></msubsup><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>C</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T^{C}_{T}\leftarrow(\,R^{C}_{T},\,p^{C}_{T}\,)</annotation></semantics></math>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.36" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.36.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">/* </span><span id="algorithm1.4.36.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Step 6: head by fixed torso-to-head transform  */</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.37" class="ltx_listingline">
                      <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.37.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">29</span></span>
                    <math id="algorithm1.m33" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T^{C}_{H}\leftarrow T^{C}_{T}\,T^{T}_{H}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>C</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>C</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>T</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T^{C}_{H}\leftarrow T^{C}_{T}\,T^{T}_{H}</annotation></semantics></math>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.38" class="ltx_listingline">
                      <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.38.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">30</span></span>
                    <span id="algorithm1.4.38.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> <math id="algorithm1.m34" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(T^{C}_{L},\,T^{C}_{R},\,T^{C}_{T},\,T^{C}_{H})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>C</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>C</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>C</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>C</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(T^{C}_{L},\,T^{C}_{R},\,T^{C}_{T},\,T^{C}_{H})</annotation></semantics></math>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.39" class="ltx_listingline">
</div>
</div>
</figure></li>
<li id="Pt0.A2.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">2.</span> 
<div id="Pt0.A2.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Pt0.A2.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Pt0.A2.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Whole-body IK solvers (alternative).</span> HoMMI-style whole-body IK <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib40" title="" class="ltx_ref">48</a>]</cite> jointly resolves torso and arm configurations from EE targets and could replace the heuristic above. We document this compatibility for completeness; our Astribot S1 results in §<a href="#S6.SS2" title="6.2 Real-World Tasks ‣ 6 Evaluation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6.2</span></a> use the heuristic exclusively.</p>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="Pt0.A2.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.2 </span>Track-B Reachability and Data Hygiene</h3>

<div id="Pt0.A2.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Pt0.A2.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Because UMI demonstrations are captured without a robot in the loop, they intrinsically lack any guarantee of reachability for arbitrary target morphologies. We deploy two standardised pre-deployment hygiene protocols, both executed <em id="Pt0.A2.SS2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">offline</em> with zero runtime overhead:</p>
<ul id="Pt0.A2.I2" class="ltx_itemize" style="--ltx-enum-leftmargin:1.6em;">
<li id="Pt0.A2.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="Pt0.A2.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Pt0.A2.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Pt0.A2.I2.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Unitree G1 <math id="Pt0.A2.I2.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\&amp;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>&amp;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\&amp;</annotation></semantics></math> Astribot S1.</span> A pre-deployment reachability verification bounds the planned task envelope to the platform; tasks exceeding the humanoid’s reachable shell are excluded from this report.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Pt0.A2.I2.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="Pt0.A2.I2.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Pt0.A2.I2.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Pt0.A2.I2.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">JAKA K1.</span> The post-training UMI corpus for a given JAKA task is filtered via a single-pass IK feasibility check on the target arm; trajectories that violate JAKA’s arm kinematics are removed from the post-training set.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
<p id="Pt0.A2.SS2.p1.2" class="ltx_p">Neither mechanism alters the policy or its action representation; they merely enforce distributional alignment between the post-training set and the physical deployment frontier.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="Pt0.A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>FlowPRO Hyperparameters</h2>

<div id="Pt0.A3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Pt0.A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Confirmed implementations:</p>
<ul id="Pt0.A3.I1" class="ltx_itemize" style="--ltx-enum-leftmargin:1.6em;">
<li id="Pt0.A3.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="Pt0.A3.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Pt0.A3.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Pt0.A3.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Iterations:</span> <math id="Pt0.A3.I1.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k\in\{1,2,3\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k\in\{1,2,3\}</annotation></semantics></math>; each round runs <math id="Pt0.A3.I1.i1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="25\,000" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>25 000</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">25\,000</annotation></semantics></math> optimizer steps (<math id="Pt0.A3.I1.i1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="75\,000" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>75 000</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">75\,000</annotation></semantics></math> total).</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Pt0.A3.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="Pt0.A3.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Pt0.A3.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Pt0.A3.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Batch size:</span> Global batch size of <math id="Pt0.A3.I1.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="20" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>20</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">20</annotation></semantics></math> (<math id="Pt0.A3.I1.i2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>5</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">5</annotation></semantics></math> samples per GPU).</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Pt0.A3.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="Pt0.A3.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Pt0.A3.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Pt0.A3.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Optimizer:</span> AdamW, initial learning rate <math id="Pt0.A3.I1.i3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1\times 10^{-5}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1\times 10^{-5}</annotation></semantics></math>, linear warmup over <math id="Pt0.A3.I1.i3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1{,}000" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>1,000</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1{,}000</annotation></semantics></math> steps, cosine decay over the next <math id="Pt0.A3.I1.i3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="15{,}000" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>15,000</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">15{,}000</annotation></semantics></math> steps to a floor of <math id="Pt0.A3.I1.i3.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2.5\times 10^{-6}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.5</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2.5\times 10^{-6}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Pt0.A3.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="Pt0.A3.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Pt0.A3.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Pt0.A3.I1.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Batch composition:</span></p>
<ul id="Pt0.A3.I1.i4.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="Pt0.A3.I1.i4.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="Pt0.A3.I1.i4.I1.i1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="Pt0.A3.I1.i4.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Pt0.A3.I1.i4.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="Pt0.A3.I1.i4.I1.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k=1</annotation></semantics></math>: <math id="Pt0.A3.I1.i4.I1.i1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}_{\text{pref}}^{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mtext>pref</mtext><mn>1</mn></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}_{\text{pref}}^{1}</annotation></semantics></math> / <math id="Pt0.A3.I1.i4.I1.i1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}_{\text{SFT}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mtext>SFT</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}_{\text{SFT}}</annotation></semantics></math> = <math id="Pt0.A3.I1.i4.I1.i1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="80/20" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>80</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">80/20</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Pt0.A3.I1.i4.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="Pt0.A3.I1.i4.I1.i2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="Pt0.A3.I1.i4.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Pt0.A3.I1.i4.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="Pt0.A3.I1.i4.I1.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k\geq 2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k\geq 2</annotation></semantics></math>: <math id="Pt0.A3.I1.i4.I1.i2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}_{\text{pref}}^{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mtext>pref</mtext><mi>k</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}_{\text{pref}}^{k}</annotation></semantics></math> / <math id="Pt0.A3.I1.i4.I1.i2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}_{\text{pref}}^{&lt;k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mtext>pref</mtext><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}_{\text{pref}}^{&lt;k}</annotation></semantics></math> / <math id="Pt0.A3.I1.i4.I1.i2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}_{\text{SFT}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mtext>SFT</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}_{\text{SFT}}</annotation></semantics></math> = <math id="Pt0.A3.I1.i4.I1.i2.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="70/15/15" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>70</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">70/15/15</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
<li id="Pt0.A3.I1.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="Pt0.A3.I1.i5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Pt0.A3.I1.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Pt0.A3.I1.i5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Distance metric:</span> To find the closest point <math id="Pt0.A3.I1.i5.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M^{\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>M</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M^{\prime}</annotation></semantics></math> on <math id="Pt0.A3.I1.i5.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau^{w}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>τ</mi><mi>w</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau^{w}</annotation></semantics></math> for a given state <math id="Pt0.A3.I1.i5.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>M</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M</annotation></semantics></math> on <math id="Pt0.A3.I1.i5.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau^{l}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>τ</mi><mi>l</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau^{l}</annotation></semantics></math>, we use <math id="Pt0.A3.I1.i5.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d(M,M^{\prime})=\|\bm{p}_{M}-\bm{p}_{M^{\prime}}\|_{2}+0.5\cdot d_{\text{geo}}(\bm{R}_{M},\bm{R}_{M^{\prime}})+0.2\cdot|g_{M}-g_{M^{\prime}}|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>M</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝒑</mi><mi>M</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝒑</mi><msup><mi>M</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>0.5</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>geo</mtext></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝑹</mi><mi>M</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝑹</mi><msup><mi>M</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>0.2</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>M</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><msup><mi>M</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d(M,M^{\prime})=\|\bm{p}_{M}-\bm{p}_{M^{\prime}}\|_{2}+0.5\cdot d_{\text{geo}}(\bm{R}_{M},\bm{R}_{M^{\prime}})+0.2\cdot|g_{M}-g_{M^{\prime}}|</annotation></semantics></math>, where <math id="Pt0.A3.I1.i5.p1.m6" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\bm{p}\in\real^{3}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝒑</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{p}\in\real^{3}</annotation></semantics></math> is the end-effector position, <math id="Pt0.A3.I1.i5.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d_{\text{geo}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>geo</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d_{\text{geo}}</annotation></semantics></math> is the geodesic distance between rotation matrices in <math id="Pt0.A3.I1.i5.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="SO(3)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>O</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">SO(3)</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="Pt0.A3.I1.i5.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="g\in[0,1]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">g\in[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math> is the normalized gripper width, and the weights are set empirically.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Pt0.A3.I1.i6" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="Pt0.A3.I1.i6.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Pt0.A3.I1.i6.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Pt0.A3.I1.i6.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Initialization:</span> The Stage-2 checkpoint serves as both initialisation <math id="Pt0.A3.I1.i6.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>θ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta</annotation></semantics></math> and frozen reference policy <math id="Pt0.A3.I1.i6.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta_{\mathrm{ref}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>ref</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta_{\mathrm{ref}}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Pt0.A3.I1.i7" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="Pt0.A3.I1.i7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Pt0.A3.I1.i7.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Pt0.A3.I1.i7.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Data scale:</span> <math id="Pt0.A3.I1.i7.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leq\mathcal{O}(10^{2})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leq\mathcal{O}(10^{2})</annotation></semantics></math> preference pairs per task; X-Trainer rollouts only.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
</section>
